#ASSERT `reg 28(14) the relevant person is required to continue to apply customer due diligence measures under paragraph (2) or (10)` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 28(14) the relevant person is required to continue to apply customer due diligence measures under paragraph (2) or (10)` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 28(16) the relevant person is able to demonstrate to its supervisory authority that the extent of the measures is appropriate` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 28(16) the relevant person is able to demonstrate to its supervisory authority that the extent of the measures is appropriate` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 28(16) the relevant person is able to demonstrate to its supervisory authority that the extent of the measures is appropriate` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 28(16) the relevant person is able to demonstrate to its supervisory authority that the extent of the measures is appropriate` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
